      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martin's_Additions%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Martin's Additions is part of the Chevy Chase community, a cluster of settlements in Montgomery County that also includes a Washington, D.C. neighborhood.",
